  "demo-penny": [
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
    "sender": "user",
    "body": "Can you plan my running week?",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 1620
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
    "sender": "agent",
    "body": "Three runs fit. Thursday is dry, so the long one goes there.\n```yui\nlist \"Mon easy 5k\"|\"Thu long 10k\"|\"Sat tempo 6k\" +check\nchoose \"Put them on your calendar?\" \"Add all three\"|\"Just Thursday\"\n```",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 1619
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
    "sender": "user",
    "body": "[yui] n2 choose choice=\"Add all three\"",
    "kind": "event",
    "meta": {
     "id": "n2",
     "preset": "choose",
     "value": {
      "choice": "Add all three"
     },
     "echo": "Add all three"
    },
    "ago_min": 1560
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
    "sender": "agent",
    "body": "Done. All three are on your calendar.",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 1559
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
    "sender": "user",
    "body": "What about the rest of the week?",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 300
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
    "sender": "agent",
    "body": "Here is how I would run your week. Monday is an easy five kilometers to loosen up after the weekend. Tuesday is strides only, short and quick, so your legs stay fresh. Thursday carries the long one, because the forecast is dry that day. Friday is a full rest day, no screens before bed. Saturday is a tempo run at a pace you can still talk through. If anything feels off, tell me and I will move the pieces around instead of dropping the week.\n```yui\nmenu shortcut \"Plan my week\"\nmenu shortcut \"Log a run: \" say=\"Log a run: \"\nmenu review@dana \"Invite Dana?\" sub=\"asked yesterday\"\n>2 stat 12 \"Runs this month\"\n```",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 299
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
    "sender": "user",
    "body": "Start a 5 minute cooldown",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 14
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
    "sender": "agent",
    "body": "Five minutes. Walk it out.\n```yui\ntimer 5m Cooldown walk\n```",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 13
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
    "sender": "user",
    "body": "How did the week look?",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 3
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
    "sender": "agent",
    "body": "Good. Three runs, all dry.\n```yui\nstat 8km \"Saturday\" sub=\"easy pace\"\nchoose@ping \"Ping you before each run?\" Yes|No\n```",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
    "ago_min": 2
   },
   {
    "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000041",
    "sender": "user",
    "body": "Plan my race week",
    "kind": "text",
    "meta": {},
